message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: fastbrute
abstract: >-
  A throughput-optimized recovery tool for the hashcat mode-4010 construction
  md5(challenge + hex(md5(challenge + secret))), with pure-Python, C/C++
  (AVX2/AVX-512, two-way ILP), and Odin backends.
type: software
authors:
  - name: TajuC
repository-code: "https://github.com/TajuC/fastbrute"
url: "https://github.com/TajuC/fastbrute"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-22
keywords:
  - md5
  - brute-force
  - simd
  - avx2
  - avx512
  - password-recovery
  - hashcat
  - security
